/E (Long before restaurants and pharmaceuticals, Mundhe's reputation was built on water. As Collector of Solapur, his work under the Jalyukt Shivar programme helped make hundreds of villages in the district tanker-free in a region where water scarcity is structural rather than seasonal. The state amed him Best Collector for all-round performance in 2015-16. Locally, he acquired a second title that has outlasted several postings: the Water Man of Maharashtra. As Municipal Commissioner of Navi Mumbai, he went after unauthorised construction, illegal hoardings and property-tax defaulters, and instituted early-morning 'Walk with Commissioner' inspections in which the city's problems were examined at street level rather than in a file. Citizens approved. Elected representatives did not. In 2016 a no-)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
