180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 48 0 R
/T (India's administrative debate tends to fixate on the top of the pyramid  secretaries, ministries, policy design. The more consequential question is what happens at the point of contact, where a licence is granted or refused, a construction is regularised or demolished, a sample passes or fails. That is where the state is actually experienced by the citizen, and it is the layer at which India's governance has been most persistently disappointing. Mundhe's career is an argument that this layer is not beyond repair. Every posting he has held has produced the same finding: the rules were adequate, the machinery was functional, and what was missing was the willingness to apply either without exception. That is an uncomfortable conclusion, because it locates the failure not in law or resources)
/E (India's administrative debate tends to fixate on the top of the pyramid  secretaries, ministries, policy design. The more consequential question is what happens at the point of contact, where a licence is granted or refused, a construction is regularised or demolished, a sample passes or fails. That is where the state is actually experienced by the citizen, and it is the layer at which India's governance has been most persistently disappointing. Mundhe's career is an argument that this layer is not beyond repair. Every posting he has held has produced the same finding: the rules were adequate, the machinery was functional, and what was missing was the willingness to apply either without exception. That is an uncomfortable conclusion, because it locates the failure not in law or resources)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
