/Title (Twenty-five transfers is usually read as the story of a difficult officer. It is more accurately read as the story of a system that has repeatedly tested whether a standard can be made to bend, and has repeatedly received the same answer. THE DARK STORES  the 13 August quick-commerce drive: 86 establishments inspected, 14 licences suspended across Blinkit, Zepto and Instamart. This is the strongest new material because it's the newest and least covered in profile terms  the crackdown came after he had already shut some of Mumbai's most popular eateries, including four Domino's outlets, and Maharashtra's drive is drawing attention precisely because food safety enforcement has historically been thin. The section argues quick commerce was an entire untested layer of the food economy. It also gives you a second verified quote for a pull-out)
